 "remarks": "Absolutely delightful co-op ready for immediate move-in and an incredible value at this price! This top-floor unit offers a spacious, light-filled bedroom, updated full bath with walk-in shower, generous living/dining room, updated kitchen with ample cabinets & gas cooking stove, hardwood floors, recessed lighting, and a sizeable private deck.***Monthly common charges include heat, hot water, and taxes-fewer utilities and systems for the buyer to worry about. Laundry and storage are conveniently located in the basement, just two floors down with interior access. 1 reserved parking space.***Convenient to I-95 and the Darien border, with shops and restaurants within walking distance. Cove Island Beach & Park, Downtown Stamford, and the train station are all nearby.***Owner-occupants only. No pets or rentals. Co-op board approval and buyer qualifications required.",
